 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Flat modules over domains are torsion-free",
 "statement": "Let $A$ be a commutative domain and $M$ an $A$-module. If $M$ is flat over $A$ [def-weil-pbc-flat-ring-map], then $M$ is torsion-free: for every nonzero $a\\in A$, multiplication by $a$ on $M$ is injective.",
